## netlab-corpus v1
## id: c11-show-bank-switch
## kind: switch
## topo: switch-hosts
## provenance: authored
## note: every switch ShowKind against the switch-hosts seed (vlan 10
## note: "blue", fa0/3 access 10). fa-alias abbreviations exercise the
## note: switch ifmap family; `## tick` proves idle hosts emit nothing.

enable
conf t
vlan 20
name red
state suspend
exit
interface f0/1
switchport mode trunk
switchport trunk allowed vlan 10,20
exit
interface fast0/2
switchport mode access
exit
interface fastethernet0/4
description unused
exit
end
## tick: +10
show vlan
show vlan brief
show mac address-table
show switchport
show ip interface brief
show interfaces
show status
show running-config
show startup-config
show version
show logging buffered
